{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "37c05697-3061-526d-b08a-f06f54946498", "source_ordinal": 1306, "reading_ordinal": 2751, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "饭难吃", "published_at": "2024-09-15T10:00:10+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/468280221/answer/3625993070"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你的权柄最多到“这个不太合我的胃口”为止，宣布“难吃”，实际上是自认为有了某种“宣布绝对客观事实”的权柄。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "作为个人，你对“是否合乎我个人的胃口”是绝对权威，你说不合就是不合，对方只能接受，无法拒绝接受。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但是作为个人，你不能判定“难吃”，因为这是一个需要对方授予判断权才能做的判断。例如对方自己请一个自己服膺的裁判团，这个裁判团才可以做这个判断而不受怨恨。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你直接宣布，意味着你自认为可以不经对方认可就有不可辩驳的真理性。", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "也就是你是口含天宪、言出即实的上帝了。", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人可以接受你宣布这不合你的口味，但绝不能接受你自命是ta必须承认的上帝。", "char_start": 233, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个雷池，是一步都不可逾越的，人类对此敏感得要命。可以说人间的纷争，绝大多数都和某人贪图快感逾越这个界限有关。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以答案当然是“有问题”。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "随时随地的明白自己的权柄到了哪里，何事有授权、何事无授权、何事需要确权，这是个永无休止的自我训练。知道得越深，越能与人保持健康的关系。", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "对这个无知且傲慢，即使是亲生的父母子女、兄弟姐妹、同志、爱侣，也一样会反目成仇。", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 448}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0400"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我嫌弃我父母做饭难吃有问题吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“饭难吃”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你的权柄最多到“这个不太合我的胃口”为止，宣布“难吃”，实际上是自认为有了某种“宣布绝对客观事实”的权柄。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你的权柄最多到“这个不太合我的胃口”为止，宣布“难吃”，实际上是自认为有了某种“宣布绝对客观事实”的权柄。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 53, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "baf536a1-e267-593c-bff9-0f0a0b84043e", "source_ordinal": 1305, "reading_ordinal": 2752, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "闭上鸟嘴", "published_at": "2024-09-15T14:24:55+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/395628fe732b11efba1352540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人为什么不放心？什么叫做不放心？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不放心的要害，就在于害怕你有什么坏消息没说、你有什么可怕的事情在隐瞒。而ta们之所以这么担心，是因为你的确有很多瞒报危险信号、危险事态的记录。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "都是锅炸上天了，ta们才知道。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "于是ta们感到恐惧，出现要逼问你一切信息的强迫症，掐着你的脖子，要把你的视觉神经接到ta们自己的大脑上，恨不得比你还先看到你的画面。", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 171}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你也觉得惭愧，你天天想着“我得多给ta们一些好消息，用好消息来证明我是靠谱的，这样ta们就放心了”，然后拼老命去制造大大小小的喜报，像精卫填海一样往父母的忧愁之海里投，是吧？", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 259}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但这实际上是错的。", "char_start": 260, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "为啥说是错的？因为你这招肯定早就用过了，就是没用，你现在才会迫切的觉得要加大剂量、要拿出更多的好消息，不是吗？你以为问题只是出在捷报不够多、不够大，只要够多、够大，父母、爱人就会放心了，是吗？", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 366}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "但你事实上是在罔顾“这一招已经用了很多次都无效”的事实。", "char_start": 367, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "为什么这样做无效？因为你在迫不及待的传完每一个你觉得可以传的捷报之后，“出乎父母意料的炸锅”是否就再也没有出现过了？", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "当然不是。你第一次报喜“数学得了第一名”之后还有十来年呢，你哪可能从此就万事如意？你当然还会有失败，还会有父母没有得到预警的失败。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 520}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "一旦发生这种失败，结合你之前的捷报，给父母的总结论是什么？是你每次报完捷报后，在ta们眼里你就处在一个“利好出尽、利空将至”的状态。", "char_start": 521, "char_end": 587}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "“你但凡有点喜可报，你一定都第一时间报了。报完之后你就处在一个一点喜都没得可报的状态，而剩下你没说的，一定都是正在孵化中的炸弹。”——这才是你一次又一次报喜，而又一次又一次在报喜之后不可避免的出现小坎坷给父母造成的总认知。", "char_start": 588, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这就是为什么“有喜就报”对于解决“不放心”根本毫无意义，甚至是抱薪救火的原因。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 739}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你不报喜还好，你报完喜，父母脸上的笑容持续了三秒钟，就开始进入“下一颗鱼雷已经发射，三分钟内将命中我舰”的“等待灾难”状态。", "char_start": 740, "char_end": 802}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为次次如此。这十几年来，次次你报完喜，接下去都是请家长、赔礼道歉、跟别的家长谈判、去局子里捞人、去医院缝针之类的情节。", "char_start": 803, "char_end": 863}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "就是条狗，现在也知道喜报就是丧钟了。", "char_start": 864, "char_end": 882}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你还觉得“有喜即报、有喜尽报”是解决之道吗？还觉得“只是报的喜还不够多、不够大”的问题吗？", "char_start": 883, "char_end": 928}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这么跟你说——李安得了奥斯卡奖，他爹收到喜报，第一句话是“好了，你现在总可以干点正事了吧”。", "char_start": 929, "char_end": 975}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "报喜党现在醒了没？不行这边可以把大棒换成砖头的哦。", "char_start": 976, "char_end": 1001}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "所以要让人放心，要怎么做？", "char_start": 1002, "char_end": 1015}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "要制造“你不知道的，一定比你想象的好，甚至比你敢想象的最好还要好”。", "char_start": 1016, "char_end": 1050}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你不知道我月薪多少，你大着胆子乐观估计“应该超不过3万吧”，我一笑置之。后来你发现我月入十万。", "char_start": 1051, "char_end": 1098}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你不知道我有没有谈恋爱，你大着胆子猜我应该不是小白。我笑而不语，后来你自然从别处看到春光乍泄——春风已绿江南岸，你又不是瞎子，乍泄不是迟早的事么。", "char_start": 1099, "char_end": 1172}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你不知道的，最后真相大白时，都是好消息，甚至是超出你想象的好消息，你就不会再忧虑于你的无知。", "char_start": 1173, "char_end": 1219}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这才是解决“不放心”的正道。", "char_start": 1220, "char_end": 1234}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你要有足够多，甚至多到漫溢的，对方不知道的好消息。", "char_start": 1235, "char_end": 1260}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "要让对方自己慢慢发现看不见的地方更可能坐着天使。", "char_start": 1261, "char_end": 1285}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "而正是你有无数对方不知道的天使在头上盘旋，你不必在父母面前表演任何“喜报”，仅仅是淡定自若、心静如水的那个定力，就足以镇住父母满脑子的妄念。", "char_start": 1286, "char_end": 1356}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "没有消息，就是好消息。ta们受过多年的事实教育，自然安心。", "char_start": 1357, "char_end": 1386}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "而这必须经过一个“有喜不要tm的乱报”的阶段。", "char_start": 1387, "char_end": 1410}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "啥叫狗肚里藏不了二两香油？你能不能闭嘴？", "char_start": 1411, "char_end": 1431}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "知道你有报喜的毒瘾，戒了！听懂没有？", "char_start": 1433, "char_end": 1451}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "先从“两喜相权报其轻”开始，逐渐学会“八喜相权报其最轻”，到“小喜而已，何足挂齿”。", "char_start": 1452, "char_end": 1494}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "最后你练成“太过豪富，财不露白”的低调气度，才是你父母的解脱之门。", "char_start": 1495, "char_end": 1528}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "闭上你的鸟嘴，你这报喜鸟。", "char_start": 1530, "char_end": 1543}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0400"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何让人放心？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035"], "summary": "围绕“闭上鸟嘴”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人为什么不放心？什么叫做不放心？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人为什么不放心？什么叫做不放心？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8170bee8-4f3a-57a9-900a-b95db34cada4", "source_ordinal": 1304, "reading_ordinal": 2753, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "先吃亏", "published_at": "2024-09-15T16:08:36+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/667123155/answer/3626260418"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这就是不可避免的成长过程。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "理论上，专业的导师可以告诉她要怎么得体的处理这些微妙敏感的公共关系问题。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但实际上，如果她本人没有先结结实实的被亲身经历折腾到苦不堪言、望而生畏，面对那些复杂而严谨的训练，几乎必定会泛起“这有必要吗”“这至于吗”“无谓的麻烦”之类的轻慢心、懈怠心。", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 138}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不训练要吃亏，不吃亏不训练。鸡生蛋，蛋生鸡，那就一定是先有蛋。", "char_start": 139, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所以这个亏是绕不过去的。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 183}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 5}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0400"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎样看待全红婵回到老家被围堵？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005"], "summary": "围绕“先吃亏”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这就是不可避免的成长过程。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这就是不可避免的成长过程。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "31b6d412-1a33-5c0a-8a7d-4fc51bcde7a5", "source_ordinal": 1303, "reading_ordinal": 2754, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "吸引力法则", "published_at": "2024-09-15T16:31:10+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/661850875/answer/3626273993"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "完整答案说一次，一次把这个鬼问题消灭。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人容易被", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "世界观与自己不对立", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "quote", "index": 4, "text": "你认为地球是圆的，ta说地球是一个轻微不规则的圆形，不对立，ta认为地球是方的，对立。你认为地球绕着椭圆轨道绕日匀角速度环行，ta认为太阳沿着复杂轨道绕地球不定速环行，不对立；ta认为太阳沿着圆形轨道绕地球匀速飞行，对立。", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "人生观与自己兼容", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "quote", "index": 6, "text": "ta希望世界和平，自己发财，你希望世界和平，自己升官，ta发财不影响你升官，兼容；ta希望世界和平，自己当永久球长，你希望世界和平，自己当永久球长，球长只能有一个，不兼容。ta希望世界和平，你希望人类毁灭，不兼容。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 264}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "价值观与自己相似", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "quote", "index": 8, "text": "ta说得饶人处且饶人，你说仁者爱人，相似；你说无毒不丈夫，不相似。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "技能和资源与自己互补", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "quote", "index": 10, "text": "你会理论构想，ta会实验证实，互补；你会电工电器，ta会市场销售，互补；你会画图，ta会施工，互补。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 371}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "的人吸引。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这就是终极答案，不必它寻了。", "char_start": 380, "char_end": 394}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13, "quote": 4}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0400"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：从心理学角度看，人们到底是容易被「跟自己相似的人」吸引还是被「跟自己互补的人」吸引？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“吸引力法则”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“完整答案说一次，一次把这个鬼问题消灭。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "完整答案说一次，一次把这个鬼问题消灭。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d979dfc8-4cc6-5471-966d-dab2c8af7e78", "source_ordinal": 1302, "reading_ordinal": 2755, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "遥不可及", "published_at": "2024-09-16T07:54:33+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/667029889/answer/3626671545"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实这跟有离婚记录不容易谈恋爱一样，属于自然而然的结果。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“责怪企业”没有意义，没有哪家有这个打算的企业会因为“被责怪”而放下这个要求。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "要解决这个问题，对于劳动者而言，最现实的手段其实是改变自己的求职策略，拒绝“资金沉淀比例过大”的薪酬方案，更多的主张现结、快结。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这类纠纷，绝大多数都是因为有某种应付报酬没有支付发生的争议，不是啥年终奖，就是某笔离职补偿。换言之，有一笔钱，而且是一大笔钱在公司手里，要在远期支付，而这笔钱被你看成了“可期待收入”的一部分，并且影响了你的就业决策和劳动态度。结果真到了见真章的时候，你意外的发现这笔钱没了，你要打官司。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你要学会无视这些“压箱底的钱”。“离职时按N+M补偿”这条福利，不能成为你是否入职的关键要素。如果有奖金绩效方案，甚至还占到总收入的可观部分，那么就一定是周结好过月结、月结好过季结、季结好过年底结。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 377}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "总而言之，按薪酬绩效方案该结给你的钱，不可以账期太长，这是一个极大的风险因素，极易引起诉讼。", "char_start": 378, "char_end": 424}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而诉讼的代价绝不是“要打很久”“要跑腿”“有不确定性”而已，而是一定会留下一个公开可查的诉讼记录。", "char_start": 425, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这其实是一个重大的隐私泄露，但这是公共记录，你没法管理。", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 503}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这个记录的价格，就像现在这个问题所揭示的这样，其实是非常高昂的，甚至可能高昂到比你打算通过诉讼追索的那笔钱还要贵。", "char_start": 504, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为它的确会实实在在的、客观的影响到你再就业。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "尤其是以招收应届生、资浅者为主的企业，你有这个诉讼记录，对你会有很大的影响。也许你根本不是过错方，就像“离婚根本是因为对方出轨”那样，但是新的对象往往没有心情和兴致去了解具体的是非曲直。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 679}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "于是从总体上看，你可以非常直观的看到，祸根就在这种“长账期收入承诺”上。", "char_start": 680, "char_end": 716}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这个部分是危险因素，占的比例越大，你对合同就要越慎重，因为它越可能以一场代价高昂、很可能得不偿失的诉讼作为休止符。到时候，你不打这官司，要损失大笔应得的报酬；打了这官司，即使赢了，也要留下一个后患很大的记录。两个结果对你都是坏结果，而这种很容易导致“所有的结果都是坏结果”的东西，你当然别无选择，只能把它排除在“诱人的利益”之外。", "char_start": 717, "char_end": 882}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "也就是先排除掉这些可能要付出高昂的代价才能真正拿到手的福利，去考虑剩下的现结的、可靠的报酬是不是已经足以让你决定签署合同了。", "char_start": 883, "char_end": 945}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "一个看似报酬较低但干脆利索、毫无后患的选择，往往比一个看似报酬很高、但手尾很长、后患无穷的选择更值钱。", "char_start": 946, "char_end": 997}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "手尾和后患是很贵的，不光是这种“留下记录很麻烦”的问题昂贵，更糟糕的是它很容易导致你巨大的心理成本。", "char_start": 998, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "那种月结的方案，一个月没结清就会给你敲响警钟，三个月没结清你已经觉得弃不足惜，半年没结清你自然忍无可忍、义无反顾。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1106}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而那些年结的呢？其实你在三月就觉得不爽，八月已经觉得纠结焦虑，但你抱着“年尾有一大笔”的念头勉强支撑，到了年底其实没结清，只结了个八成，你怎么想？你想“毕竟也结了八成，还答应我慢慢补齐呢”。", "char_start": 1107, "char_end": 1202}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "在总金额一样的前提下，后者具有强得多的迷惑性，会严重的扭曲你的果断决策，有大得多的可能性会占用你更多的职业生命。", "char_start": 1203, "char_end": 1259}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "真正值钱的是你的职业生命，不是这几千、几万块钱。", "char_start": 1260, "char_end": 1284}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为假设你一共可以有四十年职业生涯，这四十年里的第一年和第四十年得到的报酬是有巨大的差异的，第四十年你有最大的人脉、最强的经验、最厚的资本，收入是第一年那个菜鸟的十倍以上。", "char_start": 1285, "char_end": 1371}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "但你在这期间耽误的每一年，在本质意义上都是从尾部扣除你最黄金的那一段。", "char_start": 1372, "char_end": 1407}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你耽误两年，等于把40年职业生涯缩短到38年，问题是，你失去的不是收入最低的第1、第2年，也不是你被耽误的第7、第8年，而是收入最高的第39、40年。", "char_start": 1408, "char_end": 1483}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这才是这种黏黏糊糊的、让你难以快速决断的结算逻辑给你造成的真正代价。", "char_start": 1484, "char_end": 1518}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "简单来说，不要对那些论年来兑现的福利太在意，在求职的时候就不要赋予它太大的影响权重，这对你将来快意人生有很大的好处。", "char_start": 1519, "char_end": 1577}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0400"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：大量求职者因有劳动仲裁诉讼记录遭拒录，如何看待企业这一规定？求职者如何维权？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“遥不可及”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实这跟有离婚记录不容易谈恋爱一样，属于自然而然的结果。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实这跟有离婚记录不容易谈恋爱一样，属于自然而然的结果。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2decd147-7c0b-5087-a5a5-69233b5e98e1", "source_ordinal": 1301, "reading_ordinal": 2756, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "天眼查", "published_at": "2024-09-16T08:09:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/30028658/answer/3626678211"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "中国的车牌不是给人看的，是给天眼看的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "监控看得清、机器视觉识别率高，压倒一切审美需求。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "以这个硬性需求为前提，再看各国车牌，就会发现我国车牌是最科学的——它直奔“最大字号 + 最大反差”而去。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这跟好看没关系，跟其他国家的社会管理还没有进化到全面应用天眼系统有关。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 133}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 4}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0400"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：感觉中国蓝底白字的车牌很丑。是纯粹因为美学还是受“发达地区很多是白底黑字所以白底黑字好看”因素的影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004"], "summary": "围绕“天眼查”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“中国的车牌不是给人看的，是给天眼看的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "中国的车牌不是给人看的，是给天眼看的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3e565c39-af7c-523b-b48e-5809f77f4322", "source_ordinal": 1300, "reading_ordinal": 2757, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "最终负责人综合症", "published_at": "2024-09-17T20:09:58+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/68187662/answer/3627934433"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个很可能是“最终负责人综合症”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "什么叫“最终负责人”呢？", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "比如油瓶倒了，张三经过觉得没啥大不了的，李四经过觉得反正王五会弄，王五看见心想我就不信我不弄你们没人弄，结果没曾想真的一星期没人弄。最后总要有一个人解决，于是最后王五没办法，去解决了。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 123}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "脏衣服扔沙发上，张三喜欢扔，李四无所谓，天天坐在上面打游戏还觉得垫件衣服屁股更软呢，王五心里不爽，我就不信我不弄你们一辈子发现不了。结果衣服越堆越多，眼看家里快没衣服穿了。最后只好王五去收拾。", "char_start": 124, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "碗筷丢在水池里，张三觉得没所谓，反正下一顿餐桌上会自动出现干净碗筷，李四也无所谓，反正碗里的“污渍”也就是上一顿自己吃过的东西，没啥好嫌弃的，最后只有王五来保证“干净的碗筷自动出现在桌面上”。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这就叫“最终负责人”。", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 329}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你可别搞错了，这个最终负责人可不是“单位负责人”“企业负责人”那样的一把手，ta仅仅只是最终负责、最终兜底，并没有因此获得任何权利。", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "比如，ta要为衣服干净整洁负责，但是ta没有权利要求张三李四在保证衣服干净上面做任何配合——例如ta没权利要求张三李四一定要把脏衣服放进洗衣筐里，也没有权利对不配合做任何实质的惩罚——张三李四没放，ta要是批评指出，得到的反应不会是低头认错，而是对ta胆敢越权批评的反驳和报复。", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 536}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "ta甚至不会因为在这么被动的条件下做到了衣服整洁可用而得到感激和奖赏。", "char_start": 537, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "就是这么个“纯最终负责人”。一般的组织原则讲求“责权利一致”——负这个责，就一定要有能干预这个责是否发生的权，一定要为负这个责的风险、运用这个权的劳累，获得相应的利润。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 657}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这个家里的最终负责人呢？没有这个权，也没有这个利，只有这个责。", "char_start": 658, "char_end": 689}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "没有权——家里别的人都觉得ta“多事”“麻烦”“不消停”“破坏气氛”，嫌ta给自己增加负担，增加唠叨。", "char_start": 690, "char_end": 741}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "没有利——家里人觉得容忍ta的唠叨就已经算法外开恩了，怎么还能为“本来就该ta负责的事情”来感激ta，奖励ta？", "char_start": 742, "char_end": 798}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "只有责。看懂没有？", "char_start": 799, "char_end": 808}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "为什么只有责？", "char_start": 809, "char_end": 816}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为某个神奇的原因，这个家里只有ta不忍心家庭成员用脏盘子吃饭，穿没洗干净的衣服出门。", "char_start": 817, "char_end": 860}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "除了ta会急、会担忧、会焦虑，其他人不会急、不担忧、不焦虑。ta急了、担忧了、焦虑了，ta非常笨拙的行动了、解决了，于是其他人果然可以不急、不担忧、不焦虑了，可以从容的指责ta“根本没必要急 / 担忧 / 焦虑”了。", "char_start": 861, "char_end": 969}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "quote", "index": 18, "text": "1.唯我独尊，拥有极强的好胜心，她说是对的东西不可能是错的。不能忍受别人和她意见不同，一旦对她发出反对意见则会被进行一整天的嘶吼性说教以及各种精神暴力。", "char_start": 970, "char_end": 1046}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "那么为什么张三不负责、李四不负责？王五既然负责，王五就要掌握事情的推进权，张三李四既然不负责，就不存在用各种“道理”来解释自己不需要配合的合理性。公司的老板责权利一体，ta发下来的任务安排哪位员工会拿出无限的合理理由决定不予执行吗？你的理由合理，你也一样要执行吧？你会坚持到老板拍桌子才懂得“这不是讲道理的事，而是谁负责谁拍板”的事吗？", "char_start": 1047, "char_end": 1215}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "quote", "index": 20, "text": "2.严重的被害妄想，别人对她有意无意的表示都被她视为一种伤害或阴谋。", "char_start": 1216, "char_end": 1250}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这个需要你自己当一当“默认最终负责人”之后自己体会体会。", "char_start": 1251, "char_end": 1279}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这倒不见得对方一定正确，但这是默认最终负责人的通病。ta们一般都处在筋疲力尽却应付不来的状态，很想掩耳盗铃的维持“一切都还过得去”的假象，恐惧这个假象被任何人揭破。因为一旦“这些还不够、还不及格”的真相被揭破，就意味着已经筋疲力竭的自己还需要再挤出更多的心力和体力来去追求更好的结果。", "char_start": 1280, "char_end": 1422}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "没了，干了，你们懂吗？", "char_start": 1423, "char_end": 1434}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "没了，干了，一滴都挤不出来了，你们懂吗？", "char_start": 1435, "char_end": 1455}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "“这个分数你们再不满意，我没了、干了、一滴也不剩了，能麻烦你们认命吗？能不能不要再暗示了？”——这个念头，在你读书的之后有没有对爹妈想过？", "char_start": 1456, "char_end": 1525}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "哦豁，那你也有偏执型人格障碍的症状了。", "char_start": 1526, "char_end": 1545}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "quote", "index": 27, "text": "3.内心非常的敏感脆弱，时常痛哭或暴怒，独自在家的时候会自己嘶吼起来，觉得所有的人都对不起她。长时间处于压抑的情绪状态下。", "char_start": 1546, "char_end": 1607}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你每天晚上守夜打更，于是没有盗贼行窃，但民众怨声载道——“根本没有小偷，每天晚上搞得我们睡不好觉”。", "char_start": 1608, "char_end": 1658}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "乘以二十年。", "char_start": 1659, "char_end": 1665}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "quote", "index": 30, "text": "4. 口头禅是“和我作对的人都没有好下场。”", "char_start": 1666, "char_end": 1688}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这个就太过分了，可以判个几年。", "char_start": 1689, "char_end": 1704}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "quote", "index": 32, "text": "这些情况表现为：1.在公共场合，经常因为陌生人一些无意识的行为被她视为对她的攻击或者侮辱，从而在公共场合大吵大闹，说全世界的人都要害她欺负她什么的。", "char_start": 1706, "char_end": 1780}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "二十年。", "char_start": 1781, "char_end": 1785}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "quote", "index": 34, "text": "2.每个人对待她都只能小心翼翼，导致她的亲戚，我的父亲，她的朋友全都远离她，现在只剩下我了。恶性循环导致她现在失去对所有人的信任，并且视唯一留下的我为她可以控制的工具。", "char_start": 1786, "char_end": 1870}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "为什么只剩下你了？因为你的确在这所有人中是最可以原谅的那个，因为你年纪小，不懂。更何况你是亲生的，也舍不得怪你。", "char_start": 1871, "char_end": 1927}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "那些占了二十年便宜，拖把到了面前都懒得抬脚、还要怪拖地的人多事、麻烦的人，从什么角度还可以保留她的信任？", "char_start": 1928, "char_end": 1980}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "quote", "index": 37, "text": "3.视自己为全世界最伟大最宽容的人，觉得所有离开她的人都不理解她的仁慈，他们都得不到自己的宽恕。", "char_start": 1981, "char_end": 2029}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "说实话，以一些人在网上吵架的积极性，换了ta们来做这么二十年的“最终负责人”，恐怕已经出了刑事案件了。", "char_start": 2030, "char_end": 2081}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "你们家里出了刑事案件了吗？", "char_start": 2082, "char_end": 2095}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "如果还没有，“全世界最伟大最宽容”可能有待吉尼斯委员会认证，但是相对于在网上一言不合就跟人吵架的人，“仁慈”这个定性是没啥问题的。", "char_start": 2096, "char_end": 2161}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "至于“理解“，很显然从叙述语气上看，你的确是不理解，不是吗？", "char_start": 2162, "char_end": 2192}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "“得不到宽恕”这句——宽不宽恕，毕竟在当事人自己，这不好说。但是这么说吧，具体来说“没得到宽恕”的人到底吃了什么具体的来自ta的报复呢？", "char_start": 2193, "char_end": 2261}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "ta只是在用“我没宽恕”这种念头在安抚自己的强烈损失感，其实ta什么可怕的事情都没做，真要有人写封信给ta，“你不用管，我来替你报仇，不用你承担任何责任”，你觉得ta会不会给“我绝不会宽恕”的人挨个打电话示警？", "char_start": 2262, "char_end": 2367}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "quote", "index": 44, "text": "4. 记仇，十几年前的一点小事会被记到现在每天念叨。", "char_start": 2368, "char_end": 2394}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "去nm的“十几年前的一件小事”。", "char_start": 2395, "char_end": 2411}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "小你妹的事。", "char_start": 2412, "char_end": 2418}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "quote", "index": 47, "text": "5.如果被她控制的人试图脱离她的控制，就会被视为不忠。", "char_start": 2419, "char_end": 2446}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "没有权的“最终负责人”，总是会忘记自己没有权利，总是会把“我本来就没有权利，对方可以不听我的”和“我有权利，但受到了背叛”混为一谈。", "char_start": 2447, "char_end": 2513}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "这就是ta没有认清自己的地位了。ta总是假定既然我主动付起了这个责任，而同时这个家里的成员都是彼此相爱的，我就会因为主动承担了这个责任自动的获得其他人的授权，享有对应的权利。", "char_start": 2514, "char_end": 2601}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "ta太天真了。", "char_start": 2602, "char_end": 2609}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "是因为这个天真的误解，才会误把其他人的“你可以主动负责，但我有权不配合”误认为了“你主动负责，也自动获得了对应的权利，但我要背叛我的义务”。", "char_start": 2610, "char_end": 2680}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "至于这错在不在ta，取决于你觉得“为人抱薪者，不可使其冻毙于风雪”这话是否成立。", "char_start": 2681, "char_end": 2721}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "毕竟对方是未经你同意，自己去抱薪。凭啥这就意味着对你自动产生了不令其冻毙于风雪的义务？", "char_start": 2722, "char_end": 2765}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "你说是吧？", "char_start": 2766, "char_end": 2771}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "将上述状态乘以二十年的长度，就是“偏执性人格障碍”的基础配方。", "char_start": 2773, "char_end": 2804}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "至于这应该怎么办，老实说没啥办法。", "char_start": 2805, "char_end": 2822}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "本来也不是完全没办法，但对于没法自己看明白这些道理、甚至觉得这些道理很荒谬的人，那些办法都没法实施。", "char_start": 2823, "char_end": 2873}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "那只能怪这位“最终负责人”命不太好，遇上了觉得没有“免冻毙义务”的学术派别。", "char_start": 2874, "char_end": 2912}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "谁叫你不经许可去抱薪？", "char_start": 2913, "char_end": 2924}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "你是自愿的，你已经“享受了圣洁感、奉献感”，所以你于我无恩。", "char_start": 2925, "char_end": 2955}, {"paragraph_id": "P061", "field": "body", "index": 61, "text": "还不退下，你这偏执型人格障碍者。", "char_start": 2956, "char_end": 2972}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 54, "quote": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0400"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我的母亲是否有偏执型人格障碍，我该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060", "P061"], "summary": "围绕“最终负责人综合症”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个很可能是“最终负责人综合症”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个很可能是“最终负责人综合症”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d047bd11-7388-5d76-806c-f96d44f68013", "source_ordinal": 1299, "reading_ordinal": 2758, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "尽亲尽孝", "published_at": "2024-09-18T03:01:06+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/312fbc6e752711efafc25254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "子女满18岁之后，就要视为独立的人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "父母可以继续做，但不能再视为一种义务，而要视为一种特殊的友情，一种特殊的优待服务。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这具体包含以下措施：", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "1）拜访子女的住所要预约。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "2）称呼子女要按照子女同意的称呼。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "3）可以询问但不可以追问子女的隐私。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "4）未经请求，不要再给子女意见，实在想给，得要加上一句“我是否可以给你一些参考”，并且必须以“具体情况我也不了解，只能你自己决定”结尾。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "5）到了赡养阶段，可以要求支付赡养费，但永远不可以询问子女的经济收入。子女要告知，也拒绝了解。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "6）绝不对子女做大额赠送，只提供借贷、融资、投资服务。子女借钱、融资要写借条、要有还款计划、有利息和抵押。你可以在遗嘱里写上必要的免债条件，但这个设计不要告知子女。子女请求投资，需要提供相关的资历证明、现金流数据和经营计划。", "char_start": 240, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "7）建立合法遗嘱，默认仅将三分之一财产的继承权给予子女，其它部分默认捐给国家或自己指定的慈善机构；另立一份备用遗嘱，这份遗嘱将2/3遗产赠予子女，注明这份遗嘱替代前一份遗嘱生效的条件。原则上不要购买以子女为受益人的人寿/医疗/意外保险。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 471}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "8）不要与子女合住。拜访子女，要有预先约定的日程安排，留宿不要超过三天。默认自费住酒店。不经邀请，只在玄关、客厅活动，不进厨房、卧室、书房。不帮手做饭、打扫、整理什物。", "char_start": 472, "char_end": 556}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "9）原则上不与子女谈论信仰、zz立场话题。可以谈论艺术、旅游、专业技术以及家族新闻。", "char_start": 557, "char_end": 599}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "10）未经邀请，不提供育儿意见和建议。即使经邀请，也不要提供指导性意见，只提供“我是怎么做的，我得到的效果为何”这样的参考信息。", "char_start": 600, "char_end": 664}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "11）遇到子女提出要求提供家务、育儿方面的援助，可以直接给予借款，支持ta们雇佣保姆、钟点工。如果资金不充裕，这一支援金宁可自己去打工赚取。", "char_start": 665, "char_end": 735}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "12）在不赠与婚恋资金、以礼相待的前提下，不干预任何子女的婚恋决策，不打听、不干预、不做任何负面表态，也不对子女的婚姻生活做任何未经邀请的指导或批评。", "char_start": 736, "char_end": 811}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "始终记住，父母对子女的义务，永远仅限于“最友善的陌生人”。", "char_start": 812, "char_end": 841}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "无论你有多少爱，一旦你逾越这条界限——尤其是在子女到达法定成年年纪之后——其结果一定是负面的，对你们的关系也罢、对你们本人也罢、对你们的子女也罢，最后一定是负面影响大于正面影响。", "char_start": 842, "char_end": 931}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "因为你在假借爱的名义侵犯和剥夺另一个独立的成年人的自由、损害ta“完全承担生存责任”的尊严，从根基上损害对方的完整人格。", "char_start": 932, "char_end": 992}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "无论是施予还是领受，除了彼此相许的爱侣之外，一个成年人能给予另一个成年人的爱的极致，仅限于“最友善的陌生人”。", "char_start": 993, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "作为施予者，当最友善的陌生人会拒绝时，你就要拒绝。当最友善的陌生人也不会给予时，你也不可以给予。da那个最友善的陌生人会愤怒时，你也要愤怒。但最友善的陌生人不得不离开时，你也不得不离开。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1142}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "哪怕身为父母——尤其是身为父母——必当如此。", "char_start": 1143, "char_end": 1165}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "作为领受者，对你不能指望最友善的陌生人给予的，你不可以向父母索取；你不能期待最友善的陌生人能容忍的，你不可以要求父母容忍； 你对最友善的陌生人会尽的礼仪，你不可以对父母怠慢。", "char_start": 1166, "char_end": 1253}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你要问何为孝道，“最友善的陌生人”所应得的一切，父母都不应该短缺，这就是孝道的准绳。", "char_start": 1254, "char_end": 1296}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "双方以此共识互相严守，就可以乐观的期待亲子可以善终，甚至成为终身的幸福源泉。", "char_start": 1297, "char_end": 1335}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "以任何理由自认为可以做得比这更多，自认为有伟大的父爱、孝道，看不起“最友善的陌生人”的位格而要逾越这条红线，你能期待的最好的结局也只是在临终之前一笑泯恩仇。", "char_start": 1336, "char_end": 1414}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "而在你得到这个可以指望的最好结局之前——如果你真有这个运气得到的话——你们亲情必定要先经过若干年的怨恨、刻毒、猜忌、报复的轮番折磨。", "char_start": 1415, "char_end": 1481}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "“最友善的陌生人”听上去似乎“标准太低”，但事实上已经是一个近乎于神迹的慈悲境界。", "char_start": 1482, "char_end": 1523}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "向着它奔跑尚且未必能及，何况背道而驰呢。", "char_start": 1524, "char_end": 1544}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你要问，这已经答了。", "char_start": 1545, "char_end": 1555}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这答案你们也听到了。", "char_start": 1556, "char_end": 1566}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你们可以不信、不服——一听就能信能服，那是需要巨大的天赋和奇迹般的阅历的，所以不能信，不能服实属平常，近乎“正常”。", "char_start": 1567, "char_end": 1625}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "但这个回答对与不对，你们各行其道吃了苦头时，尤其是已经陷入绝望时，一定要自己回头捡起来回顾一遍。", "char_start": 1626, "char_end": 1674}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "也许你能信、能服的时候对你与你的上一代/下一代为时已晚，那么到了那时，去救你们的下下一代，不要让自己这两代人的血泪白费，让后代再重走苦路。", "char_start": 1675, "char_end": 1744}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "其实所谓的成才立业，并不如代代相传的明白且坚守这道理重要。", "char_start": 1745, "char_end": 1774}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "能明白和坚守这道理，你们的家族迟早会有一代人成才立业。", "char_start": 1775, "char_end": 1802}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "不能明白和坚守这道理，家族是否能保祭祀不绝尚且渺茫，一代两代人侥幸成才立业，并不会改变家族趋向断绝的趋势。", "char_start": 1803, "char_end": 1856}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "自己慢慢体验吧。", "char_start": 1857, "char_end": 1865}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 38}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0400"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：老人因为婆媳矛盾跳楼，两口子该怎么处理？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037"], "summary": "围绕“尽亲尽孝”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“子女满18岁之后，就要视为独立的人。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "子女满18岁之后，就要视为独立的人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
